values (1, 'Joseph Kyalo', 'Software Engineer · Fintech, Mobile & AI Agents', 'I build payment-grade products for SACCOs, landlords and small businesses, from the database schema to the mobile app to the AI agent on top.', 'I''m a Nairobi-based software engineer with a BSc in Software Engineering. At Wakandi Labs I build WayPoint, the in-house CRM for a fintech platform serving SACCOs and microfinance institutions, and AI agents that research, score and analyse data with a human approving every action.

